    <item>
      <title>Marky 1.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:02:44 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.3.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/stefanskotte/marky/releases/tag/v1.3.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2 dir="auto">What's fixed</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Images with paths starting with <code class="notranslate">/</code> now show</strong>, in the app and in Quick Look. Many GitHub READMEs write <code class="notranslate">&lt;img src="/Images/board.jpg"&gt;</code>, which GitHub reads from the top of the repository; Marky now does the same (also for a downloaded copy without git). Images that worked before are unchanged.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
