    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Marky 1.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:52:22 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.2.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/stefanskotte/marky/releases/tag/v1.2.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2 dir="auto">What's new</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>GitHub style.</strong> Settings → General → Style: choose <strong>GitHub</strong> to see files exactly as github.com shows them (light and dark), or keep <strong>Marky</strong>. Quick Look follows the choice.</li>
<li><strong>Emoji shortcodes</strong> like <code class="notranslate">:rocket:</code> and <code class="notranslate">:white_check_mark:</code> now show as emoji, as on GitHub.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/stefanskotte/marky/releases/download/v1.2.0/Marky-1.2.0.dmg" length="2746252" type="application/x-apple-diskimage"
