    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Marky 1.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.1.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/stefanskotte/marky/releases/tag/v1.1.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2 dir="auto">What's new</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Automatic updates.</strong> Marky now checks for new versions and installs them for you. Use Marky → Check for Updates…, or switch automatic checks off in Settings → General. (1.0.0 can't update itself, so install this version by hand once.)</li>
<li><strong>Quick Look follows your settings:</strong> appearance, font, size, width and code highlighting.</li>
<li><strong>Same-name tabs show their folder</strong>, for example <code class="notranslate">hardware › README.md</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Arrow keys in the Files list:</strong> → opens a folder, ← closes it or goes to the parent folder.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/stefanskotte/marky/releases/download/v1.1.0/Marky-1.1.0.dmg" length="2683198" type="application/x-apple-diskimage"
